WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.497
Healthcare runs on information that

00:00:03.497 --> 00:00:04.904
arrives too late.

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:07.802
Roles, tenders, budgets and people,

00:00:07.802 --> 00:00:09.540
scattered everywhere.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.143
Qura brings it into one place.

00:00:12.143 --> 00:00:13.126
Live, every day.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:17.900
For hospitals and providers:

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:21.050
search clinicians who are already checked,

00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:23.300
qualified, and ready to start.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:28.482
For workforce suppliers:

00:00:28.482 --> 00:00:31.427
see live demand the moment it appears, and

00:00:31.427 --> 00:00:33.740
reach the named people behind it.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.370
For medical suppliers:

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:42.009
know the day a new service opens, and

00:00:42.009 --> 00:00:45.220
reach the buyer before the tender is written.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:51.763
For GP practices and care providers:

00:00:51.763 --> 00:00:55.138
fill sessions and shifts faster, and stay

00:00:55.138 --> 00:00:56.620
ahead of your ICB.

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:00.878
For clinicians:

00:01:00.878 --> 00:01:03.321
get verified once, on the official

00:01:03.321 --> 00:01:06.123
register, and be seen by every hospital

00:01:06.123 --> 00:01:07.632
and supplier on Qura.

00:01:07.632 --> 00:01:08.709
No agency fees.

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:14.939
Every organisation is checked too.

00:01:14.939 --> 00:01:17.180
Built on checks, before scale.

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:21.061
One platform. Every lens.

00:01:21.061 --> 00:01:22.340
Choose yours.
